(text "Test pads (PCB-T-02; CB-07, PCB-L-09)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 24.13 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1d660e3a-b89c-5800-acd4-d8d7eba05fd5"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: the ship FET (BQ25798 SDRV) and the 5 A fuse join the BAT node to the six battery\n   contacts (ADR 0014 item 6, ADR 0020).\n2. Absent state: never omitted. Ship mode: SDRV low, the FET off, the pack disconnected.\n3. Pack side of the ship FET: only the gauge (VC2, PBI, VC1, sense), BATP (100 Ω, 47 nF) and\n   the FET (ADR 0017). P+ TVS position DNP until CB-07 and CB-10 ask for it (line 142).\n4. Open: the Mill-Max 0965 pogo fallback land (line 47); bring-up terminal board (ADR 0020 item 9)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 229.87 0) (size 129.54 19.05) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "923ca6cd-954d-507c-ad27-6a181e96c0d3"))
